準備。 面對氣候變遷對生活與經濟帶來的衝擊，賴清德表示，國家必須提升因應能力與韌性，提出兩大關鍵戰略。 第一，兼顧即時應變與長期調適，守護國人健康安全。高溫直接關係到人民的生命與健康，像是戶外工作者、獨居長者、孩童以及慢性病患者，面對極端高溫常態化，必須強化政府與民間、跨部會與跨區域合作，建立主動預防、共同應變的高溫防護機制。 賴清德強調，目前政府已經串聯全國超過1萬處的「涼適點」，提供民眾就近避暑的場所。","sentiment":0,"tags":{"topics":[],"bull":[],"bear":[],"score":0,"highlights":[],"keywords":["綠色交通轉型","總統府","氣候變遷","運輸系統","氣候變遷對策委員"]},"time":"10/22 20:37"},{"id":"b3708050c4d19268","source":"CMoney投資網誌","category":"台股","title":"【12:17 即時新聞】大成鋼(2027)盤中續揚走強，主力與法人買盤成焦點","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxOWVVtS1lkOHQ0QmxCa19PS2NyZHFmRERyeDZUa3VhVkhOWmlCclV5bW1LS1pjdzFMeXhjX2NGLW9KcVFCZVdJMW04SmY3UGpKd1VnbUE5bUlzZnhpX3VLX1dTdFNYMlN3THktVTJHdlRlRkhNaV9DNUN3a0NPd2ZsOUI4MS1nZWRNamItY0J3?oc=5","published":1792642640,"summary":"【12:17 即時新聞】大成鋼(2027)盤中續揚走強，主力與法人買盤成焦點 CMoney投資網誌","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["法人動向"],"bull":["法人買"],"bear":[],"score":2,"highlights":[],"keywords":[]},"time":"10/22 12:17"}],"fund":{"code":"2027","rev_month":"11509","rev":12396569.0,"rev_mom":0.08895041577476724,"rev_yoy":41.071176792102655,"rev_cum_yoy":35.00228421405128,"eps_q":3.1,"eps_year":"115","eps_season":"2","net_income":8931705.0,"pe":9.98,"pb":1.49,"yield":2.96,"updated":"2026-10-25 00:33"},"tdcc":{"latest":{"date":"2026-10-22","big1000":74.76,"big400":78.94,"retail":6.55,"holders":100887},"prev":{"date":"2026-10-16","big1000":74.28,"big400":78.51,"retail":6.69,"holders":102463},"d_big1000":0.48,"d_big400":0.43,"d_retail":-0.14,"d_holders":-1576},"weekly":{"bars":[{"time":"2026-07-27","open":44.4,"high":45.15,"low":42.0,"close":43.2,"volume":110087.372},{"time":"2026-08-03","open":43.2,"high":46.95,"low":42.25,"close":46.6,"volume":103710.7},{"time":"2026-08-10","open":47.45,"high":51.5,"low":46.0,"close":47.6,"volume":139126.687},{"time":"2026-08-17","open":47.9,"high":51.6,"low":47.55,"close":50.3,"volume":102319.27200000001},{"time":"2026-08-24","open":51.0,"high":52.3,"low":48.15,"close":48.4,"volume":62942.611000000004},{"time":"2026-08-31","open":48.4